{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"4449410","name":"亰都幻都 -樱花幻舞-","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>从亰开始走进的非日常（青涩时光）</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在以亰都为首都的现代日本，少年少女们作为《符合资格者》相继觉醒，一段围绕着异界的冒险故事就此揭开序幕——</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >因一场事件为契机，少年神矢伶获得了对抗异兽的力量。转学至《比良坂学园》，为了彻底攻略异界而奋战的伶，将迎来何种曲折离奇的命运......？</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/acc7a3e3ee464e15bc8c540ed21e18e6.poster.avif?t=1784185157\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/acc7a3e3ee464e15bc8c540ed21e18e6.webm?t=1784185157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/acc7a3e3ee464e15bc8c540ed21e18e6.mp4?t=1784185157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>【游戏系统特色】</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■创新的2D×3D战斗系统</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《京都幻都》采用融合两种不同动作模式的创新战斗系统。在“2D战斗”模式下，玩家将深入探索学园地下的巨大迷宫，享受经典横向卷轴动作带来的乐趣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >当开启迷宫内特定地点出现的异界门后，则即刻切换为“3D战斗”模式，在异界门内部可运用多样化的技能攻击和技巧性动作，与敌人展开3D战斗。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/e1d56fa7b570c83e3d891a44d76dc236.poster.avif?t=1784185157\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/e1d56fa7b570c83e3d891a44d76dc236.webm?t=1784185157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/e1d56fa7b570c83e3d891a44d76dc236.mp4?t=1784185157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■借由自定义灵魂装置与守护者来强化能力</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >使用在异界探索与日常活动中获得的点数来强化灵魂装置吧！不仅可以提升装置性能，还能习得全新的动作与技能攻击。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >将在3D战斗中获得的守护者卡装备于角色身上，可大幅提升整体能力。除了火焰和冰霜等魔法攻击之外，也能施展有别于一般灵魂装置的远程离攻击！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/59eca4983eedc999eeaa8e6a3fde161d.poster.avif?t=1784185157\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/59eca4983eedc999eeaa8e6a3fde161d.webm?t=1784185157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/59eca4983eedc999eeaa8e6a3fde161d.mp4?t=1784185157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■尽情享受属于高中生的青春日常吧！</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在学园中，需要在上课前配置行动卡。完成课程后，将依据卡片内容提升各科目的能力值，同时改变与其他角色的好感度。随着剧情发展行动卡种类也将逐步增加，进一步扩展收集的乐趣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >放学后就去逛逛京都的街道吧！可以在观光景点收集情报、在商店街购物，或与同班同学共进晚餐……要如何度过都由你决定！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/8850288fa00ee7f603a705f2c8bb9739.poster.avif?t=1784185157\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/8850288fa00ee7f603a705f2c8bb9739.webm?t=1784185157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/extras/8850288fa00ee7f603a705f2c8bb9739.mp4?t=1784185157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■聊天对话、支线任务等多种娱乐要素</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在以比良坂学园为中心的日常部分，除了角色间的聊天对话，还有发生在京都市各地的任务等丰富的内容等你探索。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >通过体验这些要素，玩家将能够更深入理解《亰都幻都》的世界观以及角色们的个性。</p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/fbec8c34ec2afd00064aa881c6e297861369e7b0/header_schinese.jpg?t=1784185157","website":"https://www.falcom.co.jp/kyoxana/","developers":["Nihon Falcom"],"publishers":["Nihon Falcom","Clouded Leopard Entertainment"],"release_date":"2026 年 7 月 15 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"54.99","final":"54.99","discount":0},"supported_languages":"日语<strong>*</strong>, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 韩语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","推荐使用手柄","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","Steam 输入 API 支持","Steam 云","可用 HDR","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","角色扮演"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Settings: 1080p, 60 FPS, Performance Graphics Profile</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/6105f9b17fc7a0a8fd3d4719dc56fbd7cd2a296e/ss_6105f9b17fc7a0a8fd3d4719dc56fbd7cd2a296e.600x338.jpg?t=1784185157","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/6105f9b17fc7a0a8fd3d4719dc56fbd7cd2a296e/ss_6105f9b17fc7a0a8fd3d4719dc56fbd7cd2a296e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784185157"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/ed39e1e64521aec2e5e8c70b06413e1be41a009b/ss_ed39e1e64521aec2e5e8c70b06413e1be41a009b.600x338.jpg?t=1784185157","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/ed39e1e64521aec2e5e8c70b06413e1be41a009b/ss_ed39e1e64521aec2e5e8c70b06413e1be41a009b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784185157"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/d2fc4bb99b39561c41404c7646805dca62112ef1/ss_d2fc4bb99b39561c41404c7646805dca62112ef1.600x338.jpg?t=1784185157","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449410/d2fc4bb99b39561c41404c7646805dca62112ef1/ss_d2fc4bb99b39561c41404c7646805dca62112ef1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784185157"}]}